---
import { Container } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Page.astro';
import settings from '../../../config/settings.js';

const seo = {
	title: 'Close precision | tevsys',
	description:
		'How tevsys keeps validated close precision on real trades — mean error ≈ 0.06% under normal conditions.',
};
---

<Layout seo={seo} lang="en">
	<div class="tevsys-feature-micro-surface tevsys-feature-micro-surface--precision">
	<Container>
		<section class="feature-hero">
			<p class="feature-kicker">Verification feature</p>
			<h1>
				Close precision. Less "<span class="feature-title__accent">almost</span>": more close where it should be.
			</h1>
			<p class="feature-intro precision-hero-lead">
				The market always finds a way to charge you extra. Until now.
			</p>

			<div class="precision-hero-evidence">
				<p class="precision-hero-stat">
					<strong>{settings.documentedOperatives} documented trades</strong>
					· mean error <span class="precision-hero-stat__accent">0.06%</span> under normal conditions
				</p>
				<p class="precision-hero-secondary">
					On every close we measure tevsys’s decision and the broker’s MT5 execution separately — without
					mixing product precision with market slippage.{' '}
					<a class="evidence-link" href="/en/como-funciona?play=1#evidencia-nasdaq-100">
						Watch Nasdaq session (~3:35) →
					</a>
				</p>
			</div>

			<p class="precision-hero-geopolitical">
				Documented extremes exist too (e.g. max deviation{' '}
				<span class="precision-hero-stat__accent">−0.39%</span>, high geopolitical volatility).{' '}
				<a class="evidence-link" href="/en/features/evidencia#evidencia-contencion-489">
					Containment case (~111 ms) in Evidence →
				</a>
			</p>
		</section>

		<section id="precision-residual" class="precision-residual" aria-labelledby="precision-residual-title">
			<h2 id="precision-residual-title">Close at the limit and residual exposure</h2>
			<p>
				When you cross your limit, tevsys triggers the close and STOP immediately: you stay protected and cannot
				open more trades while STOP is active.
			</p>
			<p>
				tevsys sends the close order to leave the account flat. If the broker does not fill it on the first try,
				it retries automatically within a bounded window of up to 45 seconds, with progressive pauses. Meanwhile,
				it works silently.
			</p>
			<p>
				Only if exposure remains after that window will you see a single on-screen notice: <em>Incomplete close</em>.
				It explains what happened, that STOP remains active, and that you can close manually if you choose.
				The notice does not loop.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section id="precision-demo" class="feature-demo feature-demo--hero">
			<h2>Quick demo — 100k account</h2>
			<p class="feature-demo-hook">
				€100,000 · GER40 · 10 lots · −1% limit · <strong class="feature-title__accent">deviation €2.28 (0.0023%)</strong> · London open · ~1 min 30 s.
			</p>
			<div class="demo-video demo-video--hero demo-video--hero-elegant" id="precision-demo-container">
				<video id="precision-demo-video" controls preload="metadata" playsinline
					poster="/videos/features/evidencia-100k-ger40-londres-poster.jpg?v=20260827">
					<source src="/videos/features/evidencia-100k-ger40-londres.mp4?v=20260827" type="video/mp4" />
					Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
				</video>
			</div>
			<p class="feature-demo-attrib">
				Attribution · tevsys −1.0023% · execution 0.00 p.p. · 34 ms
			</p>
			<p class="demo-edit-note demo-edit-note--slim">
				On-screen EA UI may still appear in Spanish.
			</p>
			<p class="demo-edit-note demo-edit-note--slim demo-edit-note--bridge">
				MT5 report from the same session —{' '}
				<a class="evidence-link" href="/en/features/evidencia#evidencia-informe-mt5">5 tabs in Evidence →</a>
			</p>
			<p class="demo-edit-note demo-edit-note--slim">
				<strong>Edited video:</strong> key close moments; there may be a <strong>clock jump</strong> between cuts.
				MT5 toolbox close: <strong>−€1,002.28</strong>.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="feature-proof">
			<h2>What you can verify</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="#precision-residual">Residual exposure — retries up to 45 s and a single notice.</a></li>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="#precision-demo">Close tight to the limit (100k · GER40 demo).</a></li>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="#precision-nasdaq">Same logic on another instrument (NASDAQ).</a></li>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="#precision-stats">Same standard on a smaller account (+ step-by-step captures).</a></li>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="/en/features/evidencia#evidencia-contencion-489">Containment under stress (~111 ms sweep) — extreme case, separate from the mean.</a></li>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="#precision-volatilidad">Behaviour in high volatility — documented extreme.</a></li>
				<li><a class="evidence-link" href="#precision-logs">Traceability in MT5 logs — same small-account session.</a></li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section id="precision-nasdaq" class="feature-proof-detail">
			<h3>Demo — Nasdaq · multi-asset</h3>
			<p class="feature-proof-subtitle">Light theme in MT5 (1 min 47 s)</p>
			<p class="feature-proof-lead">
				NAS100 · +1.00% limit · close <strong class="feature-title__accent">+1.0121%</strong> exact · +0.01% threshold margin on gains.
			</p>
			<div class="demo-video demo-video--compact demo-video--light" id="precision-nasdaq-container">
				<video id="precision-nasdaq-video" controls preload="metadata" playsinline
					poster="/videos/features/precision-demo-nasdaq-poster.jpg?v=20260816soft">
					<source src="/videos/features/precision-demo-nasdaq.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
					Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
				</video>
			</div>
			<p class="demo-edit-note demo-edit-note--slim">
				Chart and panel in light theme: tevsys coexists with the visual style you choose in MT5.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section id="precision-cuenta-pequena" class="feature-proof-detail feature-proof-detail--cuenta-bundle">
			<h3>Demo on a smaller account</h3>
			<p class="feature-proof-subtitle">Same standard, less capital (1 min 13 s)</p>
			<p class="feature-proof-lead">
				−1.50% limit · <strong class="feature-title__accent">deviation €0.06 (0.002 p.p.)</strong> · high relative size · 2 Mar 2026.
			</p>
			<div class="demo-video demo-video--compact" id="precision-cuenta-pequena-container">
				<video id="precision-cuenta-pequena-video" controls preload="metadata" playsinline>
					<source src="/videos/features/precision-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
					Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
				</video>
			</div>
			<p class="demo-edit-note demo-edit-note--slim demo-edit-note--bridge">
				Summarised video; captures and MT5 report just below.
			</p>
			<p class="demo-edit-note demo-edit-note--slim precision-recapture-note" role="note">
				<strong>Panel recapture:</strong> video and captures from this session (2 Mar 2026) show the previous panel.
				Documented closes remain valid; we will replace visual pieces once we re-record with the current build.
			</p>

			<div id="precision-stats" class="precision-stats-inner">
				<h4 class="precision-stats-inner__title">What the results show</h4>
				<p class="feature-proof-subtitle precision-stats-inner__subtitle">Same session — verification in captures</p>
				<p class="feature-proof-lead feature-proof-lead--stats">
					Panel, HTML history and MT5 report from the same session (GER40): <strong>−1.50%</strong> limit, aligned close — documented deviation <strong class="feature-title__accent">€0.06 (0.002 p.p.)</strong>.
				</p>
				<details id="precision-49-evidence" class="proof-accordion">
					<summary class="proof-capture-link">Step-by-step captures — close verification</summary>
					<div class="proof-gallery">
						<p class="proof-gallery__intro">
							<strong>What you’ll see:</strong> setup → active protection → floating P&amp;L → STOP → HTML and MT5 report validation (redacted data).
						</p>
						<p class="proof-gallery__hint">Click each capture to open it full size.</p>
						<div class="proof-gallery__grid">
							<article class="proof-gallery__item">
								<p class="proof-gallery__step">Step 1</p>
								<p class="proof-gallery__title">EA configured (unlocked)</p>
								<a class="proof-gallery__zoom" href="/images/evidence/precision-49-01-desbloqueado.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open Step 1 capture full size">
									<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/evidence/precision-49-01-desbloqueado.webp" /><img class="proof-gallery__image" src="/images/evidence/precision-49-01-desbloqueado.png" alt="2 Mar 2026 GER40 session: EA configured before enabling protection." loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" /></picture>
								</a>
							</article>
							<article class="proof-gallery__item">
								<p class="proof-gallery__step">Step 2</p>
								<p class="proof-gallery__title">Protection active (locked)</p>
								<a class="proof-gallery__zoom" href="/images/evidence/precision-49-02-protegido.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open Step 2 capture full size">
									<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/evidence/precision-49-02-protegido.webp" /><img class="proof-gallery__image" src="/images/evidence/precision-49-02-protegido.png" alt="2 Mar 2026 GER40 session: EA in protected mode with lock active." loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" /></picture>
								</a>
							</article>
							<article class="proof-gallery__item">
								<p class="proof-gallery__step">Step 3</p>
								<p class="proof-gallery__title">Intermediate floating P&amp;L (positive)</p>
								<a class="proof-gallery__zoom" href="/images/evidence/precision-49-03-flotante-intermedio-positivo.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open Step 3 capture full size">
									<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/evidence/precision-49-03-flotante-intermedio-positivo.webp" /><img class="proof-gallery__image" src="/images/evidence/precision-49-03-flotante-intermedio-positivo.png" alt="2 Mar 2026 GER40 session: intermediate floating P&amp;L in profit." loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" /></picture>
								</a>
							</article>
							<article class="proof-gallery__item">
								<p class="proof-gallery__step">Step 4</p>
								<p class="proof-gallery__title">Intermediate floating P&amp;L (negative)</p>
								<a class="proof-gallery__zoom" href="/images/evidence/precision-49-04-flotante-intermedio-negativo.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open Step 4 capture full size">
									<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/evidence/precision-49-04-flotante-intermedio-negativo.webp" /><img class="proof-gallery__image" src="/images/evidence/precision-49-04-flotante-intermedio-negativo.png" alt="2 Mar 2026 GER40 session: intermediate floating P&amp;L in loss." loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" /></picture>
								</a>
							</article>
							<article class="proof-gallery__item">
								<p class="proof-gallery__step">Step 5</p>
								<p class="proof-gallery__title">STOP — daily loss reached</p>
								<a class="proof-gallery__zoom" href="/images/evidence/precision-49-05-stop-final.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open Step 5 capture full size">
									<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/evidence/precision-49-05-stop-final.webp" /><img class="proof-gallery__image" src="/images/evidence/precision-49-05-stop-final.png" alt="2 Mar 2026 GER40 session: STOP on daily loss −1.50% and automatic close." loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" /></picture>
								</a>
							</article>
							<article class="proof-gallery__item">
								<p class="proof-gallery__step">Validation A</p>
								<p class="proof-gallery__title">HTML transaction history</p>
								<a class="proof-gallery__zoom" href="/images/evidence/precision-49-06-html-transacciones-redacted.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open Validation A full size">
									<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/evidence/precision-49-06-html-transacciones-redacted.webp" /><img class="proof-gallery__image" src="/images/evidence/precision-49-06-html-transacciones-redacted.png" alt="2 Mar 2026 GER40 session: ReportHistory transactions (redacted)." loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" /></picture>
								</a>
							</article>
							<article class="proof-gallery__item">
								<p class="proof-gallery__step">Validation B</p>
								<p class="proof-gallery__title">Official MT5 summary</p>
								<a class="proof-gallery__zoom" href="/images/evidence/precision-49-07-mt5-resumen-redacted.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open Validation B full size">
									<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/evidence/precision-49-07-mt5-resumen-redacted.webp" /><img class="proof-gallery__image" src="/images/evidence/precision-49-07-mt5-resumen-redacted.png" alt="2 Mar 2026 GER40 session: official MT5 summary (redacted)." loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" /></picture>
								</a>
							</article>
						</div>
					</div>
				</details>
				<p class="proof-context-note">On the panel, “Protected until” = protection active until the time shown.</p>
				<p class="proof-links-row">
					<a class="proof-capture-link" href="/docs/precision-resumen-tecnico-v3-final.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
						Extended technical summary <span class="proof-link-meta">PDF</span>
					</a>
					<a class="proof-capture-link" href="/en/features/evidencia#evidencia-informe-mt5">
						More trades in Verifiable evidence
					</a>
				</p>
				<p class="proof-note">We publish verifiable results and traceability. The proprietary formula is not public.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section id="precision-volatilidad" class="feature-proof-detail">
			<h3>Demo in high volatility</h3>
			<p class="feature-proof-subtitle">Documented extreme (1 min 4 s)</p>
			<p class="feature-proof-lead">
				+1.50% limit · close +1.83% · <strong class="feature-title__accent">high geopolitical volatility</strong>.
				Not part of the ≈ 0.06% mean error — containment under stress.
			</p>
			<div class="demo-video demo-video--compact" id="precision-volatilidad-container">
				<video id="precision-volatilidad-video" controls preload="metadata" playsinline>
					<source src="/videos/features/precision-demo-volatilidad.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
					Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
				</video>
			</div>
			<p class="demo-edit-note demo-edit-note--slim">
				In demanding scenarios deviation can be larger than under normal conditions; protection and automatic close still hold.{' '}
				<a class="evidence-link" href="/videos-cierre-youtube">More close cases →</a>
			</p>
		</section>

		<section id="precision-logs" class="feature-proof-detail">
			<h3>No smoke: everything is logged</h3>
			<p class="feature-proof-subtitle">Traceability in MT5 logs — same trade as above</p>
			<p class="feature-proof-lead">
				The guide below shows <strong>where to look in MT5</strong> for the logs from the session you just saw: smaller account,
				GER40, <strong>−1.50%</strong> limit, 2 Mar 2026 (video + step-by-step captures).
			</p>
			<p class="demo-edit-note demo-edit-note--slim">
				Path: MT5 → File → Open Data Folder → MQL5 → Logs.
				The video uses the previous panel — recapture in progress; the folder and events are the same.
			</p>
			<div class="demo-video demo-video--compact" id="precision-logs-container">
				<video id="precision-logs-video" controls preload="metadata" playsinline>
					<source src="/videos/features/precision-logs-guide.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
					Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
				</video>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="feature-cta">
			<h2>Want to try it on your own trading?</h2>
			<p>We’ll help you check real fit with your style — no friction, no empty promises.</p>
			<a href="/en/company/contact?feature=precision&flow=demo" class="feature-cta__button">Try precision in demo</a>
		</section>
	</Container>
	</div>
</Layout>

<script>
	function playDemoIfTarget() {
		const hash = window.location.hash;
		const map = {
			'#precision-volatilidad': 'precision-volatilidad-video',
			'#precision-demo': 'precision-demo-video',
		};
		const id = map[hash];
		if (!id) return;
		const video = document.getElementById(id);
		if (video) {
			video.play().catch(() => { /* silent fallback if the browser blocks autoplay */ });
		}
	}
	function initDemoExpand() {
		[['precision-volatilidad-video', 'precision-volatilidad-container'], ['precision-demo-video', 'precision-demo-container'], ['precision-nasdaq-video', 'precision-nasdaq-container'], ['precision-cuenta-pequena-video', 'precision-cuenta-pequena-container'], ['precision-logs-video', 'precision-logs-container']].forEach(([vid, ctn]) => {
			const video = document.getElementById(vid);
			const container = document.getElementById(ctn);
			if (!video || !container) return;
			video.addEventListener('play', () => container.classList.add('demo-video--playing'));
			video.addEventListener('ended', () => container.classList.remove('demo-video--playing'));
		});
	}
	function openEvidenceIfTarget() {
		const hash = window.location.hash;
		if (hash !== '#precision-49-evidence' && hash !== '#precision-stats') return;
		const details = document.getElementById('precision-49-evidence');
		if (details && details.tagName === 'DETAILS') details.setAttribute('open', '');
	}
	document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
		playDemoIfTarget();
		initDemoExpand();
		openEvidenceIfTarget();
	});
	window.addEventListener('hashchange', () => {
		playDemoIfTarget();
		openEvidenceIfTarget();
	});
</script>

<style>
	.feature-hero,
	.feature-demo,
	.feature-proof,
	.feature-cta {
		margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
	}
	.feature-kicker {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		opacity: 0.8;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
	}
	.feature-title__accent {
		color: #f5b041;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.feature-intro {
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.precision-hero-lead {
		margin: clamp(0.65rem, 2vw, 0.85rem) 0 clamp(1.35rem, 3.5vw, 1.75rem);
		font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.35vw, 1.12rem);
		opacity: 0.92;
		max-width: none;
	}

	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.precision-hero-lead {
			white-space: nowrap;
		}
	}

	.precision-hero-evidence {
		max-width: 72ch;
		margin: 0 0 clamp(1.35rem, 3.2vw, 1.75rem);
		padding: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.2rem) clamp(1.05rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
		border-radius: 8px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
		border-left: 3px solid rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.45);
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
	}

	html[data-theme='light'] .precision-hero-evidence {
		border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
		border-left-color: rgba(200, 135, 26, 0.5);
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.025);
	}

	.precision-hero-stat {
		margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
		font-size: 0.96rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		font-weight: 500;
		font-style: normal;
		opacity: 0.94;
	}

	.precision-hero-stat strong {
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.precision-hero-stat__accent,
	.feature-hook__accent {
		color: #f5b041;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	html[data-theme='light'] .precision-hero-stat__accent {
		color: #c8871a;
	}

	html[data-theme='light'] .feature-hook__accent {
		color: #c8871a;
	}

	.precision-hero-secondary {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		opacity: 0.82;
	}

	.precision-hero-secondary .evidence-link {
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.precision-hero-geopolitical {
		max-width: 72ch;
		margin: 0 0 clamp(0.85rem, 2vw, 1.1rem);
		font-size: 0.96rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		opacity: 0.88;
	}

	.precision-residual {
		max-width: 72ch;
		margin: 0 0 clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem);
		padding: clamp(0.85rem, 2vw, 1.15rem) clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
		border-radius: 0.55rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.22);
		background: rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.05);
	}

